{
    "title": "GolfNow Compete",
    "description": "GolfNow Compete \u2013 Golf GPS & Scoring\r\n\r\nMake every round count with GolfNow Compete. Challenge yourself and your friends with the #1 app in competitive golf. Raise the stakes with custom competitions and exciting side games that add excitement to every hole. Plus, you can register for local events, improve your game with stat tracking and use the built-in golf course GPS and rangefinder to measure shots and select the right club every time. \r\n \r\nPlay for more than bragging rights  \r\n\u2022 Compete against your friends in unique multi-games and track standings on the live leaderboards\r\n\u2022 Add virtual wagers to the round and put some skin in the game\r\n\r\nKeep your game sharp \r\n\u2022 Track your round with state-of-the-art golf course GPS maps and yardages for 30,000+ courses worldwide \r\n\u2022 Identify areas you can improve your game with advanced scoring and stat tracking\r\n\r\nDitch the paper scorecard \r\n\u2022 Make every shot count and score live with up to eight golfers on the built-in scorecard\r\n\u2022 Score for your friends when they forget their phone, or add guests and we\u2019ll share the scorecard with them\r\n\u2022 Add your Handicap to your profile and even the playing field with the Net scoring format\r\n \r\nTee off against anyone, anywhere   \r\n\u2022 Search for tournaments and outings near you from the Compete tab, or create your very own public or private event.\r\n\u2022 Find, invite and add your friends to join you in competitions, group rounds, your favorite games and virtual wagers.\r\n \r\nGolfNow Compete is for golfers, by golfers, and we want to hear from you! If you have feedback for us, please email us at compete@golfnow.com \r\n \r\nTerms of Use:\r\nhttps://www.golfnow.com/support/about-us/terms\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy?intake=Golf\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices:\r\nhttps://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?intake=Golf\r\n\r\nCA Notice:\r\nhttps://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=Golf",
